      <items xsi:type="form:FormField">
        <name>MethodOfRevaluation</name>
        <id>205</id>
        <visible>true</visible>
        <enabled>true</enabled>
        <userVisible>
          <common>true</common>
        </userVisible>
        <dataPath xsi:type="form:DataPath">
          <segments>MethodOfRevaluation</segments>
        </dataPath>
        <titleLocation>Left</titleLocation>
        <toolTipRepresentation>Button</toolTipRepresentation>
        <handlers>
          <event>OnChange</event>
          <name>MethodOfRevaluationOnChange</name>
        </handlers>
        <extendedTooltip>
          <name>MethodOfRevaluationExtendedTooltip</name>
          <id>207</id>
          <title>
            <key>en</key>
            <value>&lt;b>Revaluate&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>at&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>fair&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>value.&lt;/>
Fair value is specified in a document.
Replacement value and accumulated depreciation are recalculated so that the book value after revaluation would be equal to the fair value.&lt;b>
&lt;/>
&lt;b>Revaluate&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>at&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>replacement&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>value.&lt;/>
Replacement value is specified in a document.
Accumulated depreciation is recalculated in proportion to the value change.
The book value after revaluation is equal to the difference between the replacement value specified in the document and the recalculated depreciation.
</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>fa</key>
            <value>&lt;b>تجدید ارزیابی&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>به&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>ارزش&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>منصفانه.&lt;/>
ارزش منصفانه در سند مشخص می‌شود.
ارزش جایگزینی و استهلاک انباشته به‌گونه‌ای محاسبه مجدد می‌شوند که ارزش دفتری پس از تجدید ارزیابی برابر با ارزش منصفانه شود.&lt;b>
&lt;/>
&lt;b>تجدید ارزیابی&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>به&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>ارزش&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>جایگزینی.&lt;/>
ارزش جایگزینی در سند مشخص می‌شود.
استهلاک انباشته به نسبت تغییر ارزش محاسبه مجدد می‌شود.
ارزش دفتری پس از تجدید ارزیابی برابر با تفاوت بین ارزش جایگزینی مشخص‌شده در سند و استهلاک محاسبه مجددشده است.
</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>ru</key>
            <value>&lt;b>Переоценка&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>по&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>справедливой&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>стоимости&lt;/>
В документе указывается справедливая стоимость
Восстановительная стоимость и накопленная амортизация пересчитываются таким образом, чтобы балансовая стоимость после переоценки равнялась справедливой стоимости&lt;b>
&lt;/>
&lt;b>Переоценка&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>по&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>восстановительной&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>стоимости&lt;/>
В документе указывается восстановительная стоимость
Накопленная амортизация пересчитывается пропорционально изменению стоимости
Балансовая стоимость после переоценки будет равна разнице между восстановительной стоимостью, указанной в документе и пересчитанной амортизацией
</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>tr</key>
            <value>&lt;/>&lt;b>Gerçeğe uygun&lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/>&lt;b>maliyetten&lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;b>yeniden değerleme&lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/>
Gerçeğe uygun maliyet, belgede belirtilir
Geri kazanılabilir maliyet ve birikmiş amortismanlar, yeniden değerleme sonrasında defter değeri gerçeğe uygun maliyete eşit olacak şekilde yeniden belirlenir&lt;b>
Yenileme maliyeti üzerinden &lt;/>
&lt;b>yeniden değerleme&lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;/>
 Yenileme maliyeti belgede belirtilir
Birikmiş amortisman, maliyetin değişimiyle orantılı olarak yeniden hesaplanır
Yeniden değerleme sonrası defter değeri, belgede belirtilen yenileme maliyeti ile yeniden hesaplanan amortisman arasındaki farka eşit olacaktır
</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>vi</key>
            <value>&lt;b>Đánh giá lại&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>theo&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>giá trị&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>hợp lý&lt;/>
Trong chứng tư chỉ ra giá trị hợp lý
Giá trị phục hồi và khấu hao lũy kế được tính lại như sau, để giá trị ghi sổ sau khi đánh giá lại bằng giá trị hợp lý&lt;b>
&lt;/>
&lt;b>Đánh giá lại&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>theo&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>giá trị&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>phục hồi&lt;/>
Trong chứng từ chỉ ra giá trị phục hồi
Việc khấu hao lũy kế được tính tỷ lệ với việc thay đổi giá trị
Giá trị sổ sách sau khi đánh giá lại sẽ bằng chênh lệch giữa giá trị phục hồi được chỉ ra trong chứng từ và việc khấu hao được tính lại
</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>it</key>
            <value>&lt;b>Revaluate&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>at&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>fair&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>value.&lt;/>
Fair value is specified in a document.
Replacement value and accumulated depreciation are recalculated so that the book value after revaluation would be equal to the fair value.&lt;b>
&lt;/>
&lt;b>Revaluate&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>at&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>replacement&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>value.&lt;/>
Replacement value is specified in a document.
Accumulated depreciation is recalculated in proportion to the value change.
The book value after revaluation is equal to the difference between the replacement value specified in the document and the recalculated depreciation.
</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>pl</key>
            <value>&lt;b>Revaluate&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>at&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>fair&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>value.&lt;/>
Fair value is specified in a document.
Replacement value and accumulated depreciation are recalculated so that the book value after revaluation would be equal to the fair value.&lt;b>
&lt;/>
&lt;b>Revaluate&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>at&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>replacement&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>value.&lt;/>
Replacement value is specified in a document.
Accumulated depreciation is recalculated in proportion to the value change.
The book value after revaluation is equal to the difference between the replacement value specified in the document and the recalculated depreciation.
</value>
          </title>
          <formatted>true</formatted>
          <type>Label</type>
          <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
